    {
      "id": "claim_330100e2bbfd4503aa357e03c62cc897",
      "statement": "Journaled layout is detected purely by geometry: for v3 images, has_journal_layout() checks inode_table_block == data_bitmap_block + data_bitmap_blocks() + JOURNAL_RESERVED_BLOCKS (33 blocks: 1 header + 32 ring). The journal header at data_bitmap_block + data_bitmap_blocks() carries magic JRNL (0x4A52_4E4C). Non-journaled images are unchanged; SuperBlock struct is identical.",
